 765	### Data Tables
 766	
 767	Use real `<table>` elements for tabular data. Wrap in a scrollable container for wide tables.
 768	
 769	```css
 770	/* Scrollable wrapper for wide tables */
 771	.table-wrap {
 772	  background: var(--surface);
 773	  border: 1px solid var(--border);
 774	  border-radius: 12px;
 775	  overflow: hidden;
 776	}
 777	
 778	.table-scroll {
 779	  overflow-x: auto;
 780	  -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
 781	}
 782	
 783	/* Base table */
 784	.data-table {
 785	  width: 100%;
 786	  border-collapse: collapse;
 787	  font-size: 13px;
 788	  line-height: 1.5;
 789	}
 790	
 791	/* Header */
 792	.data-table thead {
 793	  position: sticky;
 794	  top: 0;
 795	  z-index: 2;
 796	}
 797	
 798	.data-table th {
 799	  background: var(--surface-elevated, var(--surface2, var(--surface)));
